{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20208","headline":"吊元鲁山 七 · 孟郊","name":"吊元鲁山 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"箫韶太平乐，鲁山不虚作。\n千古若有知，百年幸如昨。\n谁能嗣教化，以此洗浮薄。\n君臣贵深遇，天地有灵橐。\n力运既艰难，德符方合漠。\n名位苟虚旷，声明自销铄。\n礼法虽相救，贞浓易糟粕。\n哀哀元鲁山，毕竟谁能度。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}